```mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Client Layer [Frontend Client - React 18 / TypeScript]
        UI[Monaco Code Editor & Terminal UI]
        Zustand[Zustand Global State Store]
        Axios[Axios HTTP Client + Interceptors]
        SignalRClient[SignalR WebSocket Client]
    end

    subgraph Gateway & Ingress [Reverse Proxy / Web Server]
        Nginx[Nginx Reverse Proxy :80/:3000]
    end

    subgraph Application Server [ASP.NET Core 8 Web API - Clean Architecture]
        API[Web API Gateway :5000]
        AuthCtrl[AuthController - HTTP-Only Cookie JWT]
        ProjectCtrl[ProjectsController]
        FileCtrl[FilesController]
        ExecCtrl[ExecutionsController]
        AICtrl[AIController]
        Hub[ExecutionHub - /hubs/execution]
        Middlewares[RFC 7807 ProblemDetails / RateLimiter / SecurityHeaders]
    end

    subgraph Data & Queue Tier [Infrastructure Storage]
        Postgres[(PostgreSQL 16 - Relational DB)]
        Redis[(Redis 7 - Queue & Live Input Streams)]
    end

    subgraph Worker Tier [Background Execution Engine]
        Worker[ExecutionWorker HostedService]
    end

    subgraph Sandboxed Docker Containers [Ephemeral Isolated Sandboxes]
        direction TB
        PySandbox["Python 3.11 Sandbox (net=none, 256MB RAM, 1 CPU, non-root)"]
        NodeSandbox["Node.js 20 Sandbox (net=none, 256MB RAM, 1 CPU, non-root)"]
        GoSandbox["Go 1.22 Sandbox (net=none, 256MB RAM, 1 CPU, non-root)"]
        OtherSandbox["C# / C++ / Rust Sandboxes"]
    end

    subgraph External AI Cloud [OpenRouter LLM Intelligence]
        OpenRouter[OpenRouter API - Free LLM Models / Claude / Llama / Gemini]
    end

    %% Communication links
    UI --> Zustand
    Zustand --> Axios
    Zustand --> SignalRClient
    Axios --> Nginx
    SignalRClient --> Nginx

    Nginx -->|/api/*| API
    Nginx -->|/hubs/*| Hub

    API --> Middlewares
    Middlewares --> AuthCtrl
    Middlewares --> ProjectCtrl
    Middlewares --> FileCtrl
    Middlewares --> ExecCtrl
    Middlewares --> AICtrl

    AuthCtrl --> Postgres
    ProjectCtrl --> Postgres
    FileCtrl --> Postgres
    ExecCtrl --> Postgres
    ExecCtrl -->|Enqueue Job| Redis

    AICtrl --> OpenRouter
    AICtrl --> Postgres

    Worker -->|Dequeue Job| Redis
    Worker -->|Read & Update Status| Postgres
    Worker -->|Stream Output Chunks| Hub
    Hub -->|Real-time Logs WebSocket| SignalRClient

    Worker -->|Docker.DotNet Engine| PySandbox
    Worker -->|Docker.DotNet Engine| NodeSandbox
    Worker -->|Docker.DotNet Engine| GoSandbox
    Worker -->|Docker.DotNet Engine| OtherSandbox

    Worker -.->|Auto-Fix on Error| AICtrl
```
